    "q-164480": {
      "dom_id": "step-q164480",
      "name": "Question 5",
      "problem": "Identify the following surface:\n\n$$\n{x}^{2}=8y,\\,-\\infty <z<\\infty .\n$$",
      "worked_solution": "Recall that the equation of a parabolic cylinder, whose axis is the $z$-axis, is given by\n\n$$\n{x}^{2}=4py.\n$$\n\nThus, our equation is a parabolic cylinder with $p=2.$",
